[1] Physgun | [2] Toolgun | [3] Gravgun
[Q] or [Tab] Open Spawn Menu
[Left Click] Use Active Weapon
[Right Click] Freeze Prop (Physgun)
[E + Mouse] Rotate Prop (Physgun)
[R] Unfreeze Prop / [Shift+R] Clear All
[T] Activate Spawned Thrusters"
